# --- Preventive guards -------------------------------------------------------
# This is a DATA-ONLY repository. The system source code, the teaching corpus and
# the retrieval cache are deliberately NOT published (see README.md, "What is NOT
# included and why"). The rules below exist so that none of them can be committed
# by accident. Verified at the time of writing: no tracked file matches any of
# these patterns, so nothing currently published is affected.

# Source code (withheld by the authors' decision)
*.py

# Retrieval cache: embeds verbatim passages of the copyrighted teaching corpus
retrieval_cache_*.json

# The teaching corpus itself, and any extracted text
*.pdf
*.txt

# Model weights and adapters (large, and not part of the data release)
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin

# Working copies and backups: these have historically carried unredacted text
*_backup*
*.backup*
